m=A.awW(A.a(["Most teams come back from an away day feeling closer and clearer. By the following Wednesday, most of that has gone. The problem is rarely the day itself.","What fades is anything that was not turned into a habit. Agreements written on flipcharts need an owner, a date and a place they will be seen again.","Before your next away day, decide which one or two rituals you want the team to keep, and plan the first three repetitions before anyone leaves the room."],l),"Team Engagement","The energy of an away day rarely survives the first full inbox. Here is how to make it last.",m,5,"why-team-away-days-fade","Why team away days fade by Wednesday")
